<title>RUSSIA: Russian May inflation 0.9 pct vs 1.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian May inflation 0.9 pct vs 1.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's monthly consumer price inflation slowed in May to 0.9 percent, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    May 97    Apr 97    May 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +0.9	+1.0	+1.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    N/A     +15.3     +58.4</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
